<p>
<FONT FACE="palatino linotype italic" SIZE="4">
This is a really awesome shoulder piece with great stats and saves.  It is a hybrids must have item.  Not only are the stats really great but it also comes with a focus effect  <a HREF =http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/spell.html?spell=3531> Haste of Mithaniel </a>
