This item is no-drop and this means that it must be looted off of the boss mob himself. In order for me to do this and keep my identity a secret I require 3 things:
<p>
1-	Station name<br>
2-	Password (which I prefer is changed before and after)<br>
3-	Characters name/class that you wish to be looting the item <br>
<p>
I have been asked a few times before to help people get this without gaining access to there account in fear of there accounts being tampered with. But it is a real pain in the ass for me to do this for many reasons.  1. Someone could be sleeping at 4am when I get the drop… which means the item rots. 2. Sending tells and guiding people through a dungeon that they have never been in can be very stressful since time is of the essence. 3. If  someone dies on the way up a corpse recovery could take to long and cost us valuable time causing the item to rot. I can assure anyone reading this that your account will NOT be tampered with in any way. I am a top seller for a reason and have over 400 feedback which means that I have done over 1000 deals and in all this time I have never and would never scam anyone out of there hobby. I am a strong believer in karma and for those that have dealt with me in the past know that I am honest, fast, and reliable. 
<p>
There is a 2 week time frame guarantee given, as long as I am not delayed by the account holder =D. This means that if your desired item is not received within 2 week you will be given an additional 50k platinum on top of you item. Your account will not be online for more then 10-15minutes max and it will be only on once when looting the item.  I will never respond to tells or guild chat. Nor will your character or station name ever be discussed, I am very discreet with all information given to me.
<p>
There is only one main requirement to this process. You MUST be level 62 or flagged for Torden, the bastion of thunder 
